<title>USA: US spot MTBE stirs slightly, but trade lackluster.</title>
<headline>US spot MTBE stirs slightly, but trade lackluster.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cts/Gallon  Prompt(Mar)	Any (Apr)	 03/06/97(PptMar)</p>
<p>Houston     76.50/77.00	76.75/77.25     76.00/76.50</p>
<p>New York    79.50/79.75	81.50/82.00 N   79.25/79.75</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Spot MTBE prices perked up slightly this week from a downtrend, partly on the gains made by NYMEX gasoline futures, players said Thursday.</p>
<p>Pricing in the out months, meanwhile, also showed improvement, with April reaching contango amid anticipation that gasoline values will continue to strengthen due to strong gasoline-to-crude crack spreads.</p>
</text>
